  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "Three teams of four, and the one that loses the ball becomes the presser.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "A thirty by twenty five area. Two teams keep it, the third presses as a unit.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 2.64,
   "text": "Switch the ball and the press has to shift its angle to follow.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 8.8,
   "text": "The moment it's cut out, the team that lost it presses back. No break.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 14.66,
   "text": "Two short water breaks, evenly spaced. Limit the possession teams to two touches.",
   "hold": 2.5,
